=== Darkness vignette ===
{{Infobox screen effect
|title=Darkness vignette
|image=Vignette.png
|image2=Vignette BE.png
|camera=Yes
|hud=No
|graphics=Fancy Minimum<ref>{{bug|MC-241321}}</ref>
|options=None
}}
This effect is a black circular blur at the corners. This effect is similar to a regular vignette. This effect appears usually in [[cave]]s; however, it can appear in any dark place. It also appears when players are inside the structure of [[trial chamber]]s.

In ''Bedrock Edition'', the vignette gradually fades in as the [[sky]] darkens below Y=32, and at Y=-12, it suddenly turns into it's full opacity.
{{-}}

